        <p class="resume-subtitle">
          <em>New York City Housing &amp; Vacancy Survey</em>
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>
            Support completion of the New York City Housing and Vacancy Survey
            (NYCHVS) through recruitment and on-site interviews.
